foreknowledge	Theihkholhna. Mihingte in mailam thu ding kitheikhol nuam hi. Ahi zongin mailam thu ding theihkholhna hong kipialo hi. Laisiangtho simna tungtawn bek a theih ding Pasian in deih hi. Pasian bek in mailam thu ding theikhol hi. Piansakte kipatna leh a tawpna ding zong Pasian in theikhol hi (Is.46:10). Kipatna nei khempeuh in beina leh tawpna nei ding hi napi mihingte tungah hih theihna Pasian in hong pialo hi. Na khempeuh Pasian deihna bangin piang hi (Efe.1:11).	Theihkholhna. Mihingte in mailam thu ding kitheikhol nuam hi. Ahi zongin mailam thu ding theihkholhna hong kipialo hi. Laisiangtho simna tungtawn bek a theih ding Pasian in deih hi. Pasian bek in mailam thu ding theikhol hi. Piansakte kipatna leh a tawpna ding zong Pasian in theikhol hi (Is.46:10). Kipatna nei khempeuh in beina leh tawpna nei ding hi napi mihingte tungah hih theihna Pasian in hong pialo hi. Na khempeuh Pasian deihna bangin piang hi (Efe.1:11). | n. ma theihna; theihkholhna, a tun ma a theih khoh, a piang ding thu theihkholhna. | ma theihna theihkholhna a tun ma a theih khoh a piang ding thu theihkholhna | Foreknowledge	C2	
